    "description": {
      "value": "This suit of +1 hide armor is sickly green and covered in thick warts and nodules, fashioned from the hide of a trollhound and imbued with some of the beast's vitality.\n\nWearing this armor gives you a \u20131 circumstance penalty to all checks made using Diplomacy to interact with trolls and a +1 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks used to Make an Impression in communities traditionally plagued by troll attacks.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Trigger:** You take damage from a melee attack while you have half or fewer of your normal maximum Hit Points\n\nYour body knits itself back together, healing you for 3d8 Hit Points.\n\n**Craft Requirements:** The initial raw materials must include the hides of at least two trollhounds (Bestiary 2 268)."
